      <activity id="7afb078d-89fe-5fbe-9f76-503e2bedd424" activityNameId="29762ccc-6f9f-5fb6-bb64-332e9ca43d1a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, import IT, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, import IT, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: 6ead7c10-1a92-3bb5-9edb-caf02f3bdeb9
Included are the electricity production in Italy, the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Ozone- and NO2-emission factors are based on published measurements made in various countries.  Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swiss data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: total electricity in Switzerland: 37 TWh
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6ead7c10-1a92-3bb5-9edb-caf02f3bdeb9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
